eth1 (internal)	192.168.1.1	❌ NO gateway here
👉 Important:
Gateway is set only on external interface (eth0)
Internal interface does NOT need a gateway
💻 Client (Internal Machine)
Interface	IP	Gateway
eth0	192.168.1.10	✅ 192.168.1.1 (RHEL server)
🔹 🔥 Key Rule
👉 Client gateway = RHEL server internal IP
👉 RHEL server gateway = upstream router
