How Rich Rules Are Applied in RHEL 9
1️⃣ Through Zones
firewalld works with zones.
Each zone can have one or more interfaces assigned.
Rich rules are applied per zone, not directly per interface.
2️⃣ Interface vs Whole Server
Option A: Apply to a specific interface
Assign interface eth1 to a zone called internal
Add rich rule to the internal zone
Only traffic coming via eth1 is affected
